// Win32 resources shared by p9ime.dll and p9ime-installer.exe.
//
// Icon resource #1 is the first (and only) ICON in each module, so it is
// "icon index 0" for ExtractIconEx-style lookups. That single index is what
// Explorer shows for the .exe, what TSF shows in the language bar/taskbar
// (ITfInputProcessorProfileMgr::RegisterProfile with uIconIndex = 0) and what
// Installed Apps shows via the uninstall key's DisplayIcon ("<dll>,0").
1 ICON "p9ime.ico"
